      "#36895"
    ],
    "enables": []
  },
  "scope_notes": "Stacked on open PR #36895; several commits in the stack are mechanical scripted-diffs that migrate direct CScriptWitness::stack accesses across the codebase.",
  "changed_since_previous": "",
  "card": "This draft PR implements optimization follow-ups on top of PR 36895, optimizing CScriptWitness serialization, iteration, and validation. It deserializes witness data directly into packed serialized bytes, inlines compact size parsing, caches the last item offset for O(1) back() access, and defers witness-to-vector conversion in VerifyWitnessProgram until needed. Author benchmarks demonstrate up to a 9x speedup (128ms down to 14ms) when validating synthetic blocks containing millions of minimal witness elements. The PR depends on #36895 being merged first.",
